    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laj dat miz naj haz ndeu.",
        "zh": "山崖下有一片茅草。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hwet de nanq raixcaix.",
        "zh": "他腰酸痛得很。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De daeuj gizneix ndaej haujlai nanz lo.",
        "zh": "他来这里很久了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cih saw neix nanzdauh mwngz mbouj rox ha?",
