        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaenx lumj meh de nei.",
        "zh": "象他母亲一样勤快。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ih maz neix?",
        "zh": "这个人为什么愁眉苦脸？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De neix mbouj youq ranz.",
        "zh": "他现在不在家。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De miz lwg nem mbouj ndaej bae lu.",
        "zh": "他有孩子牵挂，不能去了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij haeuxnaengj neix nembyadbyad.",
        "zh": "这些糯米饭粘粘的。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij namh neix net leux lu.",
